  questName: 
  questDescription: Before you head off on your grand adventure, you should probably
    have a proper weapon. Luckily, I happen to have just the thing! There's only
    one little problem... I seem to have left my sword at the blacksmith's shop.
    Go find the blacksmith and tell him I sent you. He should have the sword waiting
    for you. Take it, and then you'll be ready to face whatever dangers lie ahead.
  questObjective: '- Talk to Blacksmith'
  questTargetID: blacksmith
